---
import Section from '../Section.astro';
import Container from '../Container.astro';
import SectionHeader from '../SectionHeader.astro';

/*
  Pitch page section 2 — the problem, and why now (docs/pitch-demo-sitemap.md §4.2).

  ZERO NUMBERS, DELIBERATELY. The sitemap allows exactly one place on the site
  where a figure may appear — this section — and only if it is an externally
  verifiable, publicly-sourced, dated third-party number, cited visibly. No such
  source has been supplied yet, and the same brief states what to do in that
  case: ship the argument qualitatively rather than with a placeholder number. A
  bracketed "[X million subscribers]" here would be a fabricated traction claim
  wearing a placeholder's clothes, so there is nothing numeric in this file.

  DATA GAP (owner): a sourced, dated third-party category figure — or an explicit
  decision to run permanently without one.

  COPY STATUS: the three body beats below are lorem ipsum standing in for the
  three-part argument the brief specifies (the human problem / what the category
  already is / what that spend is not buying). `copywriter` writes the real
  version. The headings name the structure so the shape can be reviewed now.
*/
---

<Section>
  <Container>
    <SectionHeader kicker="Why now" heading="The problem is not a shortage of things to watch." />

    <div class="beats">
      <p class="lead">
        Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor
        incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud
        exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat.
      </p>
      <p>
        Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit esse cillum dolore eu
        fugiat nulla pariatur. Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa
        qui officia deserunt mollit anim id est laborum.
      </p>
      <p>
        Sed ut perspiciatis unde omnis iste natus error sit voluptatem accusantium doloremque
        laudantium, totam rem aperiam, eaque ipsa quae ab illo inventore veritatis et quasi
        architecto beatae vitae dicta sunt explicabo.
      </p>
    </div>
  </Container>
</Section>

<style>
  .beats {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-6);
    color: var(--color-text-body);
    /* Measure, not a column: every section on this page hangs off the same left
       rail (the shared Container), and line length is controlled per text block
       in ch so the argument reads as one column of thought down the page rather
       than alternating between a full-width rail and a centred narrow one. */
    max-width: 60ch;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: var(--text-md);
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }
</style>
